  1.4 "Organization" means You and every other entity that controls, is
      controlled by, or is under common control with You. "Control" means
      direct or indirect ownership of more than fifty percent (50%) of the
      voting interests, or the power to direct or cause the direction of the
      management or policies of an entity, whether by ownership, contract or
      otherwise. Revenue of an Organization is the aggregate revenue of all such
      entities, taken together; You may not reduce measured revenue by dividing
