  1.5 "Modified Version" means any work that is based on, incorporates or is
      derived from the Software, in whole or in part.

  1.6 "Revenue Threshold" means United States dollars 10,000,000
      (USD $10,000,000).

  1.7 "Annual Revenue" means the total gross revenue of the Organization, as
      reported in its financial statements:

      (a) for its most recently completed fiscal year; or

      (b) if it has not completed a fiscal year, for the twelve (12) months
          ending on the date of Your first use of the Software.

      Amounts denominated in another currency are converted to United States
      dollars at the prevailing rate on the last day of the relevant period.
      Gross revenue means revenue before deductions for costs, expenses or
      taxes, and is not reduced by losses, deferrals or intercompany
      eliminations within the Organization.

  1.8 "Commercial License" means a separate written license granted by the
      Licensor (or an authorized representative) that expressly permits use of
      the Software by an Organization whose Annual Revenue meets or exceeds the
